{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Multiply Fun 把 19×19 以內的乘法表轉化為看得見的圖形練習，適合希望理解乘法原理而非死記硬背的學生、家長與教師使用。App 以陣列、面積模型與矩形方格展示數字如何組合，讓學習者直接看見乘積的形成過程，而非只背下答案。此 App 原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-49.webp\">\n<h2>幾何圖形拆解乘法</h2>\n<p>App 將乘積視為面積，透過分割矩形來拆解因數，並把圖形規律連結到心算技巧，讓抽象的乘法變得具體。練習過程提供即時回饋，答錯的題目會被記錄下來，方便日後重溫；完成後亦可查看成績並列印 PDF 報告，家長與教師可藉此掌握學習進度。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-292-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-293-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-294-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-295-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-296-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Multiply Fun: 19×19</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:45:21.914365+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":321,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T06:26:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T20:38:44.566667+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:40.163249+00:00","content_hash":"f009d066ad19aa183daf720117052a2b4a372bea81160aa5d30b2c4a9bd46bd0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}